<PageLayout title="Partners" description="The companies Zend works with to keep your money safe.">
  <p>
    Zend keeps buyers and sellers safe by working with trusted partners. Here's who they are and what they do for you.
  </p>

  <h2>Stellar</h2>
  <p>
    Stellar is a trusted crypto network used by businesses around the world to move money quickly and cheaply. Zend uses Stellar to keep a secure, permanent record of every payment, so no one can quietly change or tamper with it.
  </p>
  <p>
    You don't need to know anything about crypto to use Zend. You pay and get paid in naira, the way you already do; Stellar works in the background to keep your money safe until the buyer confirms they've received their order.
  </p>

  <h2>Want to partner with Zend?</h2>
  <p>
    If you're a business that wants to help buyers and sellers trade safely on social media, we'd love to hear from you. <a href="/contact">Talk to us</a>.
  </p>
</PageLayout>
